   139|    // Mark senior_dev tasks via trace_id (always "senior-dev-..." from the
   140|    // submit endpoint) because the task_type column is only created by the
   141|    // self-bootstrap DDL, which requires SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN and may not have
   142|    // run yet. trace_id is in the original CREATE TABLE and is always present,
   143|    // so it is the reliable marker. task_type is checked too as a fallback.
